t `px-1` wrapper. Some sections mix `space-y-5` or `space-y-6`.\n- **Controls inputs height**: Unify input/select height to `h-10` and text size `text-[11px]` (ControlPanel already does this; GuidelineEditor input matches, but buttons vary).\n- **Action buttons**: Standardize small action buttons to `h-7 px-3 rounded-lg text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest` (ControlPanel’s Auto‑Sync). Use same in GuidelineEditor’s add button/PromptInspector close.\n- **Pills/toggles**: Ensure toggle buttons use consistent padding: `px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider`. ContextSelector matches; mirror in ControlPanel output style toggles (`px-3 py-2.5` feels slightly taller).\n- **Surface tokens**: Normalize neutral surfaces to `bg-muted/5 border-primary/10 shadow-inner` for panels and `bg-background/40 border-transparent` for inactive pills; current components sometimes use `bg-background/60` or `bg-muted/10`.\n- **Separator token**: Standardize to `Separator className="bg-gradient-to-r from-primary/20 via-primary/5 to-transparent h-px"` (ContextSelector/GuidelineEditor already use it; ControlPanel uses `bg-primary/5` line).\n\nWant me to implement these consistency tweaks directly in the components, or just apply them to a subset (e.g., ControlPanel + GuidelineEditor) first?\n</summary>\n</subagent_invocation>'}
